  m_Name: GoodMorning47
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DisplayName: Good Morning, 47
  Description: 'Your destination is the Magpie Electricals Factory in Ottawa, Canada.

    Your targets are its owner Simon Soars and Burnwood Incorporated CEO Bob Burrows,
    who will be on site for a meeting regarding private investments.

    Our client believes the factory to be a secret bomb-making facility acting under
    authority of the Council of the Sparking Diamond, a global terrorist organization
    specialized in explosive manufacture and distribution around the globe.

    I trust you can handle explosive situations.

    I will leave you to prepare.'
